For a multi-GB log file, `readFile` can exhaust memory; the stream version uses ~64 KB at a time. Caveat from the docs: if the data is already in memory, streams only add overhead.

```js
const upper = new Transform({
  transform(data, enc, cb) {
    this.push(data.toString().toUpperCase());
    cb();
